0..66 Comment "// This source shows an omitted model implicit at a manifest type."
67..69 Comment "//"
70..123 Comment "// The manifest sort distinguishes `Up` from `Flips`."
124..126 Comment "//"
127..206 Comment "// The checker selects the model whose carrier matches the fixed sort. The slot"
207..284 Comment "// `[s : Model Dial with sort C = Integer]` binds no parameter for `C`. So no"
285..359 Comment "// argument forces the sort, and the fixed sort tells the modules in scope"
360..369 Comment "// apart."
370..372 Comment "//"
373..388 Comment "// - see: #2317"
